---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { images } from '../data/assets';
const breadcrumbs=[{label:'Plan a Trip',href:'/plan-a-trip/'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Plan a Group Trip | Talon Expeditions" description="Start planning a private group, active, trekking, learn-to, cultural, cruise, or hosted trip with Talon Expeditions. A finished itinerary is not required." image={images.boat} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <section class="av-inner-hero" style={`background-image:url('${images.boat}')`}><div class="shell"><h1>Appointment</h1><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/></div></section>
  <section class="av-appointment"><div class="shell"><div class="av-appointment-head"><p class="eyebrow">Book an Appointment</p><h2>Let’s Start Planning Your Journey</h2><p>You do not need a finished itinerary, exact headcount, or final destination. Give us enough context to understand the group and the kind of trip you are trying to create.</p></div><div class="av-appointment-stage"><div class="av-appointment-figure left" style={`background-image:url('${images.backpacker}')`}></div><div class="av-appointment-figure right" style={`background-image:url('${images.coastalTraveler}')`}></div><form data-mailto-form data-subject="New Talon Expeditions planning inquiry" class="av-appointment-form" action="mailto:sales@talonexpeditions.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain"><div><label for="plan-name">Your Name</label><input id="plan-name" name="name" required/></div><div><label for="plan-email">Email Address</label><input id="plan-email" name="email" type="email" required/></div><div><label for="plan-phone">Phone Number</label><input id="plan-phone" name="phone" type="tel"/></div><div><label for="plan-org">Organization / Group</label><input id="plan-org" name="organization"/></div><div><label for="plan-type">Group Type</label><select id="plan-type" name="group-type"><option>Private group / friends</option><option>Club or community</option><option>Hiking / outdoor group</option><option>Dive / watersports community</option><option>Wellness / studio group</option><option>Business / team</option><option>Social / affinity group</option><option>Individual / public departure</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for="plan-size">Approximate Group Size</label><input id="plan-size" name="group-size" placeholder="Example: 10–16"/></div><div><label for="plan-dates">Dates / Season</label><input id="plan-dates" name="dates" placeholder="Example: September 2027"/></div><div><label for="plan-budget">Approximate Budget</label><input id="plan-budget" name="budget" placeholder="Per traveler or total"/></div><div class="full"><label for="plan-trip">Tell Us About the Trip</label><textarea id="plan-trip" name="trip-idea" required placeholder="Where do you want to go, what do you want to do, or what kind of experience are you trying to create?"></textarea></div><div class="full"><button class="button" type="submit">Submit Appointment Request</button></div></form></div></div></section>
  <section class="av-category-stage"><div class="shell av-category-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start Where You Are</p><h2 class="section-title">You do not need every answer before the first conversation.</h2><p class="av-category-copy">The most useful starting point is the information you already know.</p><ul class="av-category-menu"><li>The Group</li><li>The Destination</li><li>The Activity</li><li>The Season</li><li>The Budget</li><li>The Experience</li></ul></div><div class="av-category-visual" style={`background-image:url('${images.planning}')`}><div class="av-category-caption"><h3>We will identify the missing decisions together.</h3><p>The first response should narrow the questions that most affect viability, fit, scope, and cost.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="av-why-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">What Happens Next</p><h2>The first response should move the trip forward.</h2></div><p>We review the group and trip context, identify the biggest open questions, and determine the next useful planning step instead of treating the inquiry as a generic quote request.</p></div><div class="av-why-image" style={`background-image:url('${images.train}')`}></div><div class="av-why-grid"><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Review</h3><span class="num">01</span></div><p>Understand the actual group, objective, destination ideas, timing, and constraints.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Clarify</h3><span class="num">02</span></div><p>Identify the few decisions that most affect viability, destination fit, support, and pricing.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Plan</h3><span class="num">03</span></div><p>Move into destination comparison, itinerary design, supplier work, and group assumptions when the trip is a fit.</p></div><div class="av-why-item"><div class="av-why-item-head"><h3>Propose</h3><span class="num">04</span></div><p>Turn enough confirmed information into a concrete proposal with clearer inclusions, terms, and next steps.</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
